<subpara id="RM000000OKM00PX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FT600000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<step1>
<ptxt>Freeze Data List</ptxt>
<step2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), following the screen display, select the DTC recording freeze frame data (F displayed) from the [DTC Check] screen.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>The engine condition (ECU data) at the time of DTC detection and before and after detection (before: 1.5 seconds, after: 0.5 seconds) can be checked at 0.5-second intervals. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D502SX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Check that the malfunction symptoms from the customer problem analysis are consistent with the Diagnostic Trouble Code Chart. </ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>After repair, perform a confirmation test referring to the driving conditions confirmed below.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
